<title>FRANCE: EU cuts refund on unroasted malt exports.</title>
<headline>EU cuts refund on unroasted malt exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund on exports of unroasted malt to 35.75 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 37.70 Ecus per tonne, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
